# Optional env overrides for the workbench-viewer server.
# Copy to viewer.env (gitignored) only if you need them; every
# value can also live in config.json. Env wins over file wins
# over the defaults in server/config.py. Prefix: WB_VIEWER_.
#
# HOME=<the tree owner's home directory>
#   The one non-prefixed line: when the systemd unit runs as
#   root, DuckDB looks for its extension cache under root's
#   home and the sqlite dataset console reports itself
#   unavailable. Point HOME at the tree owner's home so the
#   cache under ~/.duckdb is found.
#
# WB_VIEWER_PORT=8792
# WB_VIEWER_HOST=127.0.0.1
# WB_VIEWER_WORKSPACE_ROOT=/path/to/workspace
# WB_VIEWER_FILE_EDITING_ENABLED=false
